This bundle contains first-party Harley-owned Wild Bunch skills and retained third-party browser-game helper skills.

First-party Wild Bunch skill trees are sourced from the attached authoritative zip files and remain Harley-owned.
Third-party browser-game helper skills are copied from retained game-studio custody and keep their upstream provenance and licensing.

See SOURCE.md and references/provenance-map.json for component-level provenance.
